{"product_id":"conquering-uncertainty","title":"Conquering Uncertainty","description":"\u003cp\u003eEminent futurist and business consultant Theodore Modis helps every executive and manager think \"long-term\" when it comes to positioning their companies for survival in a hyper-competitive environment. Viewing enterprises as living organisms, he focuses on the evolution of companies over time, offering practical advice on what leaders should and shouldn't do in response to unpredictable market changes. This book will equip managers and executives with the tools to anticipate change and make the right decisions at the right time. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:159 x 222  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Theodore Modis \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780070434059 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 198\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43403502190745,"sku":"9RC9780070434059","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/conquering-uncertainty-984789.jpg?v=1695435462","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/conquering-uncertainty","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}